            <title><![CDATA[New York prosecutors reopen investigation into alleged rape at Cornell University]]></title>
            <link>https://www.pbs.org/newshour/show/new-york-prosecutors-reopen-investigation-into-alleged-rape-at-cornell-university</link>
            <description><![CDATA[An investigation into an alleged gang rape in 2024 at Cornell University has been reopened after the woman who reported the assault sued the school and others. At the time, no criminal charges were filed, though Cornell said it investigated and took disciplinary action, including suspensions and expulsions. Amna Nawaz discussed more with Brian Mann of NPR.]]></description>
